        "tree_id": "89ee492bacd0a9f58daf666988e0e456dc856a1a",
        "message": "Add Web Reader Phase 4 - Source Manager\n\nFeatures:\n- WebSource model with full selector config\n- Predefined Vietnamese sources (6 sites)\n  + TruyenFull, Web Truyen, Mê Truyện Chữ, Truyện Chữ, YY Truyện, Đọc Light Novel\n- International sources (2 sites)\n  + NovelFull, WuxiaWorld\n- Custom source add/edit/remove\n- Source enable/disable toggle\n- Source detection from URL\n- Source search by name/url\n- Source Manager dialog with tabs (Vietnamese/International)\n- Custom source editor with CSS selectors\n- UI: Globe button in AppBar to open source manager\n\nNew files:\n- web_source.dart (source model + predefined sources + service)\n- source_manager_dialog.dart (source manager UI dialog)",
